# Hugging Face Space used for hairstyle edits (instruction-edit model).
# Chosen: FLUX.1 Kontext Dev. Verified anonymously on 1 portrait (bald, rasta: face kept well);
# skin fade + 2nd portrait NOT verified (anonymous ZeroGPU quota exhausted) -
# unverified beyond that: test with a real selfie and HF token.
# Endpoint params (view_api): /infer(input_image, prompt, seed, randomize_seed, guidance_scale, steps)
HF_SPACE=black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-Kontext-Dev
HF_ENDPOINT=/infer
# Server-side only. REQUIRED for the deployed (Render) site: the anonymous ZeroGPU quota is per IP
# and Render's IPs are shared, so without a token the site is almost always "busy".
# Optional only for a quick local try.
HF_TOKEN=
PORT=8787

# --- Backups: used automatically, in this order, when the Space above is busy or out of free quota ---
# Other Hugging Face Spaces: comma-separated "owner/space|/endpoint|image_param" (endpoint defaults to
# /infer, image_param to input_image). They use HF_TOKEN too, so another ZeroGPU Space shares the same
# daily quota; they mainly help when one Space is overloaded or down.
HF_FALLBACK_SPACES=
# Cloudflare Workers AI, FLUX.2 [klein] - FREE: 10,000 "neurons" a day (about 80-90 looks), resets 00:00 UTC.
# Account ID: Cloudflare dashboard > Workers & Pages (right side). Token: My Profile > API Tokens >
# Create Token > "Workers AI" template.
CF_ACCOUNT_ID=
CF_API_TOKEN=
# CF_MODEL=@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-2-klein-4b
# fal.ai, FLUX Kontext (paid per image): https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys
FAL_KEY=
# FAL_MODEL=fal-ai/flux-pro/kontext
# Google Gemini image editing (the image model is paid in the API): https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash-image
# How long (ms) to wait on the free Space before trying the backups (default 60000 with backups, 120000 without)
# HF_TIMEOUT_MS=60000
